@startuml
title 音频记录生命周期状态图 (AudioRecord State Machine)
hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #333
}

state "待上传 (Pending Upload)" as Pending
state "已上传 (Uploaded)" as Uploaded
state "已创建 (Created/Persisted)" as Created
state "编辑中 (Editing)" as Editing
state "已删除 (Deleted)" as Deleted

[*] --> Pending : 用户点击录音/上传

Pending --> Uploaded : 文件上传至对象存储成功
Uploaded --> Created : 提交记录信息 (UC-04)

Created --> Editing : 用户点击编辑 (UC-06)
Editing --> Created : 保存修改
Editing --> Created : 取消编辑

Created --> Deleted : 用户点击删除 (UC-06)
Deleted --> [*] : 物理删除或归档

note right of Created
  记录在数据库中持久化
  包含标题、标签、位置等信息
end note

@enduml